@startuml
title ExitPass Payment Finality to Sales Invoice to ExitAuthorization

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam participantPadding 24
skinparam boxPadding 12

participant "Payment Orchestrator" as Orchestrator
participant "Central PMS" as PMS
participant "Resolved Site\nPOS Server" as POS
participant "Gate Integration /\nExitAuthorization consumer" as Gate
participant "Vendor PMS /\nHikCentral" as Vendor

Orchestrator -> Orchestrator : Verify provider outcome
Orchestrator -> PMS : Report verified outcome
PMS -> PMS : Record payment finality
PMS -> POS : Request Sales Invoice issuance\nfor resolved Site
POS -> POS : Issue Sales Invoice\nand fiscal records
POS --> PMS : SI identity/status\nand digital SI URL if applicable
PMS -> PMS : Record fiscal reference
PMS -> Gate : Issue ExitAuthorization
Gate -> Gate : Consume ExitAuthorization
PMS -> Vendor : Synchronize payment / exit state
Vendor --> PMS : Acknowledgment / status

note over PMS,POS
Fiscal issuance happens after payment finality
and before ExitAuthorization.
POS Server never issues ExitAuthorization.
end note

note over Vendor
Vendor PMS acknowledgment is synchronization only.
It is not payment finality or exit authority.
end note

@enduml
